# M11 "Künye", flow "stats_rich" run 3 (PostgreSQL test database only, a larger window): the same
# warrior after run 2 - Güç 30, Dayanıklılık 20 (+3 from the equipped Bekçi Kalkanı), nothing left to
# spend - with the Künye and the inventory open side by side, and an attribute tooltip.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m11_rich
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+statsknown 1800
scene expectattr guc 30 0
scene expectattr dayaniklilik 20 3
scene expectunspent 0
scene expectequip main 1 off 15
expect world+nopoints
key c
waitfor world+kunye 60
key i
waitfor world+kunye+inv 60
hoveron kunye.attr.dexterity
wait 10
expecttext kunye.tooltip kritik vuruş ve kaçınma
screenshot 01_kunye_and_inventory.png
quit
